<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea buys 230,500T of grains, oilseeds in Dec.</title>
<headline>S.Korea buys 230,500T of grains, oilseeds in Dec.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea bought at least 230,500 tonnes of grains and oilseeds through tenders and private negotiations in December, compared with 231,500 tonnes in November, traders at major commodities houses said on Friday.</p>
<p>For the month, South Korea bought 27,500 tonnes of wheat, 105,000 tonnes of U.S. soybean, 45,000 tonnes of Indian soymeal, 16,000 tonnes of Chinese cottonseed meal, 5,000 tonnes of Chinese rapeseed meal and 32,000 tonnes of wheat bran pellets.  </p>
